[en.FOCUS_C07_LPEG_WARM_HOTLINE]
International Heating Hotline

[en.FOCUS_C07_LPEG_WARM_HOTLINE_desc]
Not a resident of Las Pegasus? No worries! Our International Heating Hotline provides you with 24/7 service, no matter where you are, you can contact our professional team at any time to subscribe to Las Pegasus heating services!\nIn fact, we prefer to deal with out-of-town customers... As long as you can afford the pipeline construction and maintenance fees and the remote surcharge, we will be happy to serve you!

[zh.FOCUS_C07_LPEG_WARM_HOTLINE]
国际供暖热线

[zh.FOCUS_C07_LPEG_WARM_HOTLINE_desc]
不是洛马基的居民？不用担心！我们的国际供暖热线为您提供全天候的服务，无论您身在何处，都可以随时联系我们的专业团队，订阅洛马基的供暖服务！\n事实上，相比于本地居民，我们更喜欢和外地的客户打交道... 只要是能付得起管道建设维护费和远程附加费的客户，我们都会竭诚为您服务！

